  "body_html": "<h1>twoByTwo_row_guarantee</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem twoByTwo_row_guarantee (a b c d : ℝ) (hdenom : 0 &lt; a + d - b - c) (hab : b ≤ a) (hdc : c ≤ d) : ∀ j, twoByTwoMixedValue a b c d ≤ (twoByTwo a b c d).Ej (twoByTwoRowMixed a b c d hdenom hab hdc) j</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>twoByTwo</li>\n</ul>",
